-- title:
--   Base change to ℚ̄ of both j-charts
-- statement:
--   Let $F_0$ be an intermediate field of $\mathbb{Q}$ in the Laurent series field $\mathbb{Q}((q))$, let $p$ be a natural number, and let $j \in F_0$ be an element assumed nonzero (through a `Fact` instance). Write $\iota =$ `coeffEmb` for the coefficientwise ring homomorphism $\mathbb{Q}((q)) \to \overline{\mathbb{Q}}((q))$ induced by $\mathbb{Q} \to \overline{\mathbb{Q}}$, and let $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}F_0 =$ `laurentBaseChange` be the intermediate field of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ in $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}((q))$ generated by $\iota(F_0)$. Let $jb \in \overline{\mathbb{Q}}F_0$ satisfy $jb = \iota(j)$. Put $R = \{x \in \mathbb{Q} : \gcd(\operatorname{den} x, p) = 1\}$, the subring `ratLocalizedAt p`. The assertion is twofold. First, there is an isomorphism $e_{\mathrm{fin}}$ of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$-algebras from $\overline{\mathbb{Q}} \otimes_{R} A_{\mathrm{fin}}$, where $A_{\mathrm{fin}} \subseteq F_0$ is the subalgebra of elements integral over $R[j]$, onto the subalgebra of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}F_0$ of elements integral over $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}[jb]$, such that $e_{\mathrm{fin}}(1 \otimes b) = \iota(b)$ for every $b \in A_{\mathrm{fin}}$. Secondly, there is such an isomorphism $e_{\infty}$ with $j$ replaced by $j^{-1}$ and $jb$ by $jb^{-1}$ throughout, again satisfying $e_{\infty}(1 \otimes b) = \iota(b)$.
--
--   This is the chart-by-chart form of the statement that the geometric generic fibre of the two-chart integral model over $\mathbb{Z}_{(p)}$ attached to a field of $q$-expansions $F_0$ and a nonzero $j \in F_0$ is the normalisation of the $j$-line over $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ inside $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}F_0$. It feeds the constructions of isomorphisms between curve models over $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ and the generic fibre of [`AlgebraicCurve.TwoChartIntegralModel`](def/AlgebraicCurve_TwoChartIntegralModel.html#L236) together with their Galois compatibility, and its surjectivity half is [`ModularCurve.chartRing_laurentBaseChange_le_span_coeffEmb_chartAlg`](thm.html#ModularCurve.chartRing_laurentBaseChange_le_span_coeffEmb_chartAlg).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_exists_algEquiv_tensor_chartAlg_chartRing_laurentBaseChange.lean

